{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "必须独立把这期节目做起来  (Pulling Off This Episode on Our Own)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Backstage at Studio One right before taping, Xin Huimei's manager asks Kaiwen and Unit Two's co-producer to slot Bai Yang in as a last-minute wild-card duet—performing Luo Lin's signature hit song. Listen to Kaiwen and the manager in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "详细流程我们再过一遍，我觉得这个时间上可能有点问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "有个事情找你帮个忙，惠美想安排个外卡歌手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "白杨？这都什么时候了，马上就要录制了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这竞演歌曲是洛琳的代表作吧，是不是有点不妥啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这歌是惠美自己定的，她觉得白杨唱这首歌效果肯定特别好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大立了军令了，说有什么变化的话一定要向他通报。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是我们一定不能打扰老大，必须独立把这期节目做起来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "让他知道一线制作确实不用太操心了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "洛琳确实是个麻烦，但没必要草木皆兵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改流程吧，让音乐组把伴奏准备出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好，谢谢，回头我请你吃饭啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都安排好了，我去跟林姐和闻老师说一下新流程。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "详细流程我们再过一遍，我觉得这个时间上可能有点问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's run through the detailed rundown one more time; I think the timing might be tight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "有个事情找你帮个忙，惠美想安排个外卡歌手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need a favor from you — Huimei wants to add a wild-card singer to tonight's show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "白杨？这都什么时候了，马上就要录制了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bai Yang? Look at the time — we are about to start taping any minute!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这竞演歌曲是洛琳的代表作吧，是不是有点不妥啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Isn't this competition song Luo Lin's signature piece? Could that be a bit unwise?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这歌是惠美自己定的，她觉得白杨唱这首歌效果肯定特别好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei picked the song herself; she's convinced Bai Yang singing it will bring a phenomenal response.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大立了军令了，说有什么变化的话一定要向他通报。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our boss gave strict orders before leaving to notify him immediately of any changes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是我们一定不能打扰老大，必须独立把这期节目做起来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, we must not disturb our boss abroad — we have to pull off this episode on our own!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "让他知道一线制作确实不用太操心了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's show him he truly doesn't need to worry about frontline production anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "洛琳确实是个麻烦，但没必要草木皆兵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Luo Lin is certainly trouble, though there's no need to panic at every shadow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改流程吧，让音乐组把伴奏准备出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Update the rundown and have the music team prepare the backing track.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好，谢谢，回头我请你吃饭啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great, thank you — I'll treat you to dinner soon!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都安排好了，我去跟林姐和闻老师说一下新流程。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is set; I'll go brief Lin Jie and Mr Wen on the updated rundown.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "详细流程我们再过一遍，我觉得这个时间上可能有点问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "有个事情找你帮个忙，惠美想安排个外卡歌手。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "白杨？这都什么时候了，马上就要录制了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这竞演歌曲是洛琳的代表作吧，是不是有点不妥啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这歌是惠美自己定的，她觉得白杨唱这首歌效果肯定特别好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大立了军令了，说有什么变化的话一定要向他通报。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是我们一定不能打扰老大，必须独立把这期节目做起来！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "让他知道一线制作确实不用太操心了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "洛琳确实是个麻烦，但没必要草木皆兵。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改流程吧，让音乐组把伴奏准备出来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好，谢谢，回头我请你吃饭啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都安排好了，我去跟林姐和闻老师说一下新流程。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Determined to prove Unit One can run smoothly without troubling Chun Yuqiao during his overseas talks, Kaiwen approves the song and rushes the updated rundown to the stage floor. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
